{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast &amp; Spell\u00a0</strong>is an exhilarating multiplayer game where players engage in epic battles as powerful wizards, wielding the elements of nature to dominate their opponents. Enter a world where you can command the forces of fire, frost, stone, lightning,\u00a0water, and life, casting a wide range of spells to outsmart and overpower your enemies in thrilling combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Cast &amp; Spell</strong>, you can go head-to-head with other players in intense PvP duels, using strategy and mastery of different elemental combinations to emerge victorious. Prefer teamwork? Join forces with your friends in cooperative PvE modes, where you'll face hordes of monstrous creatures across diverse environments. From fast-paced skirmishes to tactical survival challenges, there's a mode for every kind of mage.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Wizard's Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1c7dd54bb5b91784368da285bbcc5d6cad38ba7c.jpg"},{"name":"Skilled Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/860de4e23a6572c7a0ef25e3f3c3041e2e71e4ed.jpg"},{"name":"Arch Wizard","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1f52d293da88d4d8ec84ebbdd3be19958a3128c5.jpg"},{"name":"Knowledge Is Power","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/485147ae2c7070b7906151a427256c233ad33254.jpg"},{"name":"First Friend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1c7dd54bb5b91784368da285bbcc5d6cad38ba7c.jpg"},{"name":"Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/860de4e23a6572c7a0ef25e3f3c3041e2e71e4ed.jpg"},{"name":"Traitor","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1c7dd54bb5b91784368da285bbcc5d6cad38ba7c.jpg"},{"name":"Death Is Not The End","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/485147ae2c7070b7906151a427256c233ad33254.jpg"},{"name":"Budget Flight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1c7dd54bb5b91784368da285bbcc5d6cad38ba7c.jpg"},{"name":"Clear Victory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3032020/1f52d293da88d4d8ec84ebbdd3be19958a3128c5.jpg"}],"total":25},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032020?t=1744966969","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3032020?t=1744966969","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032020/ca1abf778cb304a6466b64ea668dd81acaaea187/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744966969","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032020/ca1abf778cb304a6466b64ea668dd81acaaea187/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744966969","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h1>3-step spell casting!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032020/extras/casting.gif?t=1744966969\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each spell is chosen in 3 steps: spell type, spell element and the spell itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each element has a weakness for the other. If you want to be a strong mage, choose your spells wisely!</p></p><br><h1>35+ unique spells!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032020/extras/page_2_image.png?t=1744966969\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cast &amp; Spell\u00a0</strong>is an exhilarating multiplayer game where players engage in epic battles as powerful wizards, wielding the elements of nature to dominate their opponents. Enter a world where you can command the forces of fire, frost, stone, lightning,\u00a0water, and life, casting a wide range of spells to outsmart and overpower your enemies in thrilling combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <strong>Cast &amp; Spell</strong>, you can go head-to-head with other players in intense PvP duels, using strategy and mastery of different elemental combinations to emerge victorious. Prefer teamwork? Join forces with your friends in cooperative PvE modes, where you'll face hordes of monstrous creatures across diverse environments. From fast-paced skirmishes to tactical survival challenges, there's a mode for every kind of mage.</p>","developers":["Hosthood Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3032020/header.jpg?t=1744966969","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257124368,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124368/movie480.mp4?t=1744275915","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257124368/movie_max.mp4?t=1744275915"},"name":"Cast & Spell Gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps